    {"id": "MARKET-ChalhoubGroup_Unders-003", "title": "Chalhoub Group @ Copyright 2021 Strictly Confidential –Do Not Distribute Without", "content": "Chalhoub Group @ Copyright 2021 Strictly Confidential –Do Not Distribute Without AuthorizationPhase 1: \nQualitative Phase 2: \nQuantitative \n1,605 online* interviews | Feb 2021 \nSaudis only | 18 to 35 years \nFemale majority (65%)\nClothes SAR 500 \nEvery 3 months Shoes SAR 500 \nEvery 6 months \n10 cities 17 in -depth online interviews | Dec 2020 \nSaudis only | 18 to 35 years \nFemales only \nBuy fashion on a \nregular basis \n8 cities \nJeddah (15%) \nRiyadh (15%)Mecca (15%)\nDammam (13%)\nMadinah (10%)\nKhobar (7%)Tabuk (8%)\nQassim (8%)\nAbha (6%)\nKhamis Mushet \n(5%)Primary \ncities Secondary \ncities Remote", "source": "market/ChalhoubGroup-Understanding-the-Modern-KSA-Fashion-Consumer_for_partners.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
