    {"id": "MARKET-Deloitte_Digital_Con-007", "title": "8Data privacy in KSA+UAE is the primary concern among low frequency users of Gen", "content": "8Data privacy in KSA+UAE is the primary concern among low frequency users of Gen AI, much more than \nthe perceived value -add of the toolGenerative AI | Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends 2025\nWeighted base: All respondents aged 18 -50 years who have used generative AI  (1,152), less frequently than monthly, KSA+UAE (288)  UK (407)\nSource: Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends, ME and UK, 202425%\n23%\n19%\n16%\n15%\n11%\n10%\n7%\n12%\n3%19%\n16%\n14%\n14%\n18%\n16%\n21%\n4%\n16%\n9%Worried about data privacy\nDo not know how to use it well\nThink it infringes on copyright and IP\nGives inaccurate answers\nNot satisfied w", "source": "market/Deloitte_Digital_Consumer_Trends_2024.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
