    {"id": "MARKET-Deloitte_Digital_Con-009", "title": "10The most common applications of Gen AI at work in KSA+UAE are task oriented – ", "content": "10The most common applications of Gen AI at work in KSA+UAE are task oriented – i.e., searching, editing, \ntranslating whereas we are seeing increased usage in other markets around content creationGenerative AI | Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends 2025\nWeighted base: All respondents aged 18 -50 years who have used generative AI for work, 2024, KSA+UAE (544), UK (481) \nSource: Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends, ME and UK, 2024Using Gen AI for Work: Work Tasks\nWhich of the following work tasks have you used any Generative AI tools for?\n[Of those who have used Gen AI at work]\n46%\n40%\n38%\n36%\n33%\n32%", "source": "market/Deloitte_Digital_Consumer_Trends_2024.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-Deloitte_Digital_Con-010", "title": "1141%", "content": "1141%\n42%\n11%\n3%\n2%A great deal\nA fair amount\nNot very much\nNot at all\nDon\'t knowEmployees using Gen AI at work in KSA+UAE are overall positive on the impact on their productivity but a \nbit more balanced on the encouragement from their employers on the use of the toolGenerative AI | Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends 2025\nWeighted base: All respondents aged 18 -50 years who have used generative AI for work, 2024 ( 544), employed adults who are aware of generative AI  (1,006 ) \nSource: Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends, ME and UK, 2024Using Gen AI for Work : Productivity Boost\nTo what extent do y", "source": "market/Deloitte_Digital_Consumer_Trends_2024.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-Deloitte_Digital_Con-011", "title": "12", "content": "12\nMost respondents do not completely trust AI generated mails and chatbotsGenerative AI | Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends 2025\nWeighted base: All respondents aged 18 -50 years, who are aware of generative AI tool , 2024 (1,429) \nSource: Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends, ME and UK, 2024“I would be less inclined to trust an email  if I knew it was created using Generative AI.”\n“I would be less inclined to use customer services if I knew I was conversing with a Generative AI \nassistant.”Consumers are doubtful about the misleading content and misinformation from Gen AI tools. Chatbots \nemployed ", "source": "market/Deloitte_Digital_Consumer_Trends_2024.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
