    {"id": "MARKET-Deloitte_Digital_Con-039", "title": "41Online | Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends 2025", "content": "41Online | Deloitte Digital Consumer Trends 2025\nAlmost two -third of respondents have used at least once a mental \nhealth application\nMental Health Applications\nHow often, if at all, do you personally use apps dedicated to mental health support, wellness or mindfulness?\n65%\nhave used a dedicated app \nfor mental health, wellness \nor mindfulness in KSA+UAE.\nWhereas in UK this stand s \nat 57%.16%\n16%\n13%\n9%\n11%Daily\nWeekly\nMonthly\nLess then\nmonthly\nOnce or twiceIn the region, 16% of the respondents use an app for mental health support, wellness or \nmindfulness daily\nWeighted base: All respondent", "source": "market/Deloitte_Digital_Consumer_Trends_2024.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
