    {"id": "MARKET-E1_Climate_Driven_He-001", "title": "Climate-Driven Material Preferences: Heat / Sun / Sand (E1)", "content": "Climate-Driven Material Preferences: Heat / Sun / Sand (E1)\n\nText corpus format: material → GSM/weight band → functional metrics → suitable months.\n\n高温季（极热）：5–9 月（内陆白天常见 38–45°C+）。\n\nBreathable and non-cling, even in 38°C heat.\n\nLightweight airflow with a dry-touch feel.\n\nMoisture-wicking and quick-drying for all-day comfort.\n\nCool-to-the-touch fabric that stays comfortable under direct sun.\n\nSoft drape that doesn’t stick to the skin after sweating.\n\nUPF 50 blocks 98% UV (definition): https://www.skincancer.org/skin-cancer-prevention/sun-protection/sun-protective-clothing/\n\nIce silk often refer", "source": "market/E1_Climate_Driven_HeatSunSand_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E1_Climate_Driven_He-002", "title": "Ripstop + DWR product spec example (GSM listed): https://www.amazon.com/Ottertex", "content": "Ripstop + DWR product spec example (GSM listed): https://www.amazon.com/Ottertex-Waterproof-Repellent-Dustproof-Inflatable/dp/B0CFRQ2SG1\n\nKSA summer heat context (May-Sep extreme heat): https://bluegreenatlas.com/climate/saudi_arabia_climate.html", "source": "market/E1_Climate_Driven_HeatSunSand_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E2_EasyCare_Durabili-001", "title": "Easy-Care & Durability Preferences (E2)", "content": "Easy-Care & Durability Preferences (E2)\n\nText corpus format: pain point (wrinkles / color shift / pilling / wash care) + solution (fabric / construction / finishing).\n\n通勤/旅行一整天，坐车、久坐、拎包摩擦后起皱明显；到公司或聚会时整件看起来“软塌、没精神”。\n\n选 crepe / nida crepe / crepe blend：纹理本身更“抗皱”，穿着与行李箱挤压后更容易恢复。\n\n用聚酯/锦纶混纺做“形态稳定”：相比纯天然纤维更不容易皱，适合高频穿着。\n\n结构上做“垂感与留量”：更垂的版型不容易在腰臀处形成死折；宽松量足够更不显皱。\n\n易打理动作化表达：挂一晚自然平整；或轻蒸汽 30 秒快速恢复。\n\n旅行场景强调 packable：折叠/卷收也不容易出“硬折线”。\n\n选“微肌理”面料：微皱纹理（crepe/砂洗感）能弱化皱褶视觉对比。\n\n避免过薄且过光滑的面料外穿：极光滑的表面更容易显折线；如果必须用，建议做里衬或双层结构。\n\n黑色 abaya 洗几次后发灰、发红或出现“褪色条纹”；深色在日晒/反复洗涤后变得不均匀。\n\n优先“色牢度更强”的黑：强调 colorfast / fade-resistant；面料本身更", "source": "market/E2_EasyCare_Durability_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E2_EasyCare_Durabili-002", "title": "商品页把黑色拆成具体色名：jet black / deep black / soft black / charcoal black，并提供“室内光/日光/夜光”", "content": "商品页把黑色拆成具体色名：jet black / deep black / soft black / charcoal black，并提供“室内光/日光/夜光”三种示意。\n\n面料说明加一句：同为黑色，不同面料光泽不同（哑光黑 vs 缎面黑），并明确“更哑/更亮”。\n\n袖口、侧腰、包带摩擦处起球，一旦起球就显旧；深色起球更明显，影响“质感”。\n\n优先“织得更紧密”的面料：同样成分，织法更紧密更耐磨，起球更慢。\n\n在高摩擦部位做结构优化：口袋口加固、侧缝更平整、减少突起装饰与粗糙车线。\n\n可选 anti-pilling finish（抗起球整理）：减少毛羽与纤维纠结，延长“看起来像新”的周期。\n\n户外或旅行场景，衣摆与背包/车门/台阶摩擦导致起毛、勾丝、发亮。\n\n外穿层选更耐磨的 crepe 或混纺（聚酯/锦纶占比更高），兼顾垂感与耐磨。\n\n必要时用“微光泽”而非“高光泽”：高光泽更容易在磨擦处发亮显旧。\n\n选择 machine washable / easy care 面料：聚酯 crepe、nida、部分混纺更适合机洗。\n\n结构上避免“洗后变形”的风险点：减少易拉伸拼接、选择更稳定的门襟与领口结构。\n\n给出清晰机洗参数：冷水/轻柔档/反面/洗衣袋/低温烘干或阴干。\n\n在商品说明中明确“缩水风险”材质：纯棉/麻更需要预缩或更温和洗护。\n\npackable / travel-frien", "source": "market/E2_EasyCare_Durability_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E2_EasyCare_Durabili-003", "title": "Crepe abaya fabric features incl. wrinkle-resistant/durable: https://danaalhassa", "content": "Crepe abaya fabric features incl. wrinkle-resistant/durable: https://danaalhassan.com/en/blog/Crepe%20fabric%20for%20abayas/a-1300918948\n\nMachine washable silk crepe nida abaya copy: https://www.bazaralhaya.com/products/black-salam-abaya-comfy-flowy-silk-crepe\n\nAnti-pilling definition + methods: https://texauxchemicals.com/what-is-anti-pilling-in-textiles-definition-benefits-applications/\n\nSolbari fabric claim: resists pilling, shrinkage, color fading after multiple washes: https://www.solbari.com/products/everyday-performance-sun-shirt-mens", "source": "market/E2_EasyCare_Durability_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E3_Hygiene_Health_Fu-001", "title": "Hygiene & Health Functional Preferences (E3)", "content": "Hygiene & Health Functional Preferences (E3)\n\nText corpus: preference ratios (as usable benchmarks), selling-point ranking, and certification/standard keywords.\n\n偏好强度排序（热区场景常见）：抗异味 > 透汗快干 > 亲肤低刺激 > 抗菌。\n\n— “强偏好/会优先购买”人群：抗异味 50–70%；快干 45–65%；亲肤低刺激 40–60%；抗菌 25–45%。\n\n— “可接受溢价”人群：抗异味 10–25%；快干 10–20%；亲肤低刺激 8–18%；抗菌 5–15%。\n\nISO 20743（antibacterial activity of textiles）\n\nAATCC 100（antibacterial finishes quantitative test）\n\nOEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100（皮肤接触安全测试关键词）\n\nsilver-based antimicrobial / silver ion / 银离子\n\nsilver-free odor control / bio-based odor control / 无银除味（生物基）\n\nodor control finish / anti-odor ", "source": "market/E3_Hygiene_Health_Functions_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E3_Hygiene_Health_Fu-002", "title": "母婴/童装场景：亲肤低刺激通常是 Top1；成人敏感肌场景：通常 Top2（仅次于不透/舒适或抗异味）。", "content": "母婴/童装场景：亲肤低刺激通常是 Top1；成人敏感肌场景：通常 Top2（仅次于不透/舒适或抗异味）。\n\n— “强偏好/会优先购买”人群：童装 60–80%；成人敏感肌 45–65%。\n\n— “可接受溢价”人群：童装 15–30%；成人敏感肌 10–22%。\n\nProduct Class I (babies) / 产品等级：婴幼儿级别（关键词）\n\nhypoallergenic / low-irritation / gentle\n\nskin-friendly / sensitive-skin friendly\n\n热季运动场景：快干与透汗通常与抗异味并列 Top1/Top2。\n\n— “强偏好/会优先购买”人群：moisture-wicking 50–75%；quick-dry 45–70%；4-way stretch 35–60%。\n\n— “可接受溢价”人群：快干 10–25%；透汗 10–20%；弹力 8–18%。\n\nanti-odor / odor control / fresh\n\nsilver ion / silver-based / 银离子\n\nmoisture-wicking / quick-dry / breathable\n\nHeiQ Pure (silver-based antimicrobial odor control): https://www.heiq.com/p", "source": "market/E3_Hygiene_Health_Functions_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E3_Hygiene_Health_Fu-003", "title": "ISO 20743 standard page: https://www.iso.org/standard/59586.html", "content": "ISO 20743 standard page: https://www.iso.org/standard/59586.html\n\nAATCC 100 overview (QIMA): https://blog.qima.com/textile/antimicrobial-fabric-testing-importance-and-methods\n\nOEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 product classes: https://www.oeko-tex.com/en/our-standards/oeko-tex-standard-100/\n\nSolbari fabrics mention anti-odor, moisture-wicking, OEKO-TEX: https://www.solbari.com/pages/our-fabrics", "source": "market/E3_Hygiene_Health_Functions_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E4_Sustainable_Mater-001", "title": "Sustainable Material Preferences (E4)", "content": "Sustainable Material Preferences (E4)\n\nText corpus: premium ranges, purchase-motivation quotes, and claim-style copy lines (no compliance document).\n\n基础溢价（大众渠道常见写法）：+5%–15%（同版型同工艺对比）。\n\n高溢价（强调全链路/更严格标准/更强故事叙事）：+35%–60%（或更高，取决于品牌）。\n\nOEKO-TEX® STANDARD 100 (skin contact)\n\nE4-2 再生聚酯（Recycled polyester / rPET）\n\n中高溢价：+10%–25%（强调再生比例、供应链可追溯、功能型面料）。\n\n高溢价：+25%–50%（强调高再生比例 + 更强性能/更强品牌叙事）。\n\n把回收塑料变成可穿的面料：在不牺牲耐用性的前提下，减少新资源消耗。\n\nrecycled content / recycled percentage\n\nGRS (Global Recycled Standard)（行业常见关键词）\n\n低影响染（low-impact dyes）溢价：+5%–20%（强调更少有害物、减少水耗/更高吸收率等叙事）。\n\n植物染（natural/plant dyes）溢价：+15%–50%（取决于颜色深浅、批", "source": "market/E4_Sustainable_Materials_Preferences_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
    {"id": "MARKET-E4_Sustainable_Mater-002", "title": "接受度写法：76% 消费者愿意购买二手时尚（open to pre-owned fashion）。", "content": "接受度写法：76% 消费者愿意购买二手时尚（open to pre-owned fashion）。\n\n折价区间（常见口径）：相对新品 -20% 到 -60%（取决于成色与品牌）。\n\n“认证/平台验真/高成色”二手：可接受折价更小（例如 -10% 到 -30%），强调“省钱但体面”。\n\npre-loved / resale / recommerce\n\nauthenticity check / verification\n\ncondition grade / like new / gently used\n\nSaudi second-hand fashion market ($966m 2025; >$1.3bn 2030; 76% open; 32% environmental motivation): https://www.spa.gov.sa/en/N2541081\n\nGOTS standard overview: https://global-standard.org/the-standard\n\nOEKO-TEX ORGANIC COTTON overview: https://www.oeko-tex.com/en/our-standards/oeko-tex-organic-cotton/\n\nrPET benefits overview: https://blog.qima.", "source": "market/E4_Sustainable_Materials_Preferences_TextCorpus.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
