    {"id": "MARKET-Ecommerce_Impact_Tra-005", "title": "A. Abuali et al.  ", "content": "A. Abuali et al.  \n \n \nDOI: 10.4236/jssm.2024.174018 358 Journal of Service Science  and Management  \n selectively include only studies that are deemed pertinent to our research objec-\ntives.  \n- Search domain: E -commerce Trends and Developments, Traditional Busi-\nness Adaptation Strategies, Consumer Behavior and Preferences, Technolog-\nical Integration, Economic Impacts.  \n- Publication type: journals.  \nHere are the exclusion criteria that were utilized to filter out irrelevant papers:  \n- Papers that do not specifically focus on e -commerce.  \n- Papers that cover the topic of e -commerce w", "source": "market/Ecommerce_Impact_Traditional_Business_Saudi.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
