    {"id": "MARKET-Knight_Frank_Retail_-002", "title": "Saudi Arabia Retail Market Overview Saudi Arabia Retail Market Overview2 3RENTS ", "content": "Saudi Arabia Retail Market Overview Saudi Arabia Retail Market Overview2 3RENTS UNDER PRESSURE\nDespite growing interest from international \nretailers and investors, headline rents in \nsuper-regional and regional shopping malls \nremain subdued, except in Riyadh, where rents \nincreased by 4.2% to around SAR 2,845 psm. \nLooking ahead, with 7.4 million sqm of new \nretail space planned nationwide, including \n2.6 million sqm in Riyadh, rents are expected \nto face downward pressure as the growth in \nonline shopping continues to outpace in-\nstore transactions. However, the shift toward \nexperiential r", "source": "market/Knight_Frank_Retail_Overview_Autumn_2024.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
