    {"id": "MARKET-Snap_Consumer_AR_Res-025", "title": "UTILITYWhy do they use AR? ", "content": "UTILITYWhy do they use AR? \n“I need to and it’s useful”“I want to have fun and connect with friends”\n“It’s everywhere and commonplace”30TECH:TOY:TOOL:TOTALITY:OSMOSISJOYUBIQUITY“I didn’t even realize I was using it”\n\n31Why do they use AR? Osmosis61% of people use AR for communication.1 People may have a hard time describing AR, but    successfully identify  AR when they see it.273%\n1: 2021 Global Deloitte Digital Study commissioned by Snap Inc.   Base = Aggregate (n=9,511)  Q: How often do you use AR for any of the following reasons? Communication | A: Several times each day, Once a day, Sever", "source": "market/Snap_Consumer_AR_Research_GlobalReport.pdf", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
