    {"id": "MARKET-沙特报告6W-028", "title": "Thermoplastic Polyurethane (TPU) is both the dominant and faster-growing product", "content": "Thermoplastic Polyurethane (TPU) is both the dominant and faster-growing product type in Saudi Arabia’s Paint Protection Film (PPF) market, accounting for the overwhelming majority of revenue in 2031F and registering a higher CAGR than Thermoplastic Hybrid (TPH).\n\nQuartz/Silica-based (SiO₂) coatings are the dominant product type in Saudi Arabia’s ceramic coating market, accounting for the largest revenue share in 2031F, driven by their superior hardness, long-term gloss retention, hydrophobicity, and strong resistance to UV exposure, sand abrasion, and chemical contaminants in harsh desert con", "source": "market/沙特报告6W.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
