    {"id": "MARKET-沙特报告6W-030", "title": "In Saudi Arabia’s ceramic coating market, SUVs emerge as the dominant vehicle se", "content": "In Saudi Arabia’s ceramic coating market, SUVs emerge as the dominant vehicle segment, slightly surpassing sedans in 2031F revenue, reflecting the strong preference for larger vehicles and their higher per-vehicle coating requirements due to greater surface area.\n\nMarket Segmentation By Sales Channel\n\nProfessional detailing centers are the dominant sales channel in Saudi Arabia’s car window tinting film, PPF, and ceramic coating market, accounting for the largest revenue share in 2031F, as protection solutions are increasingly purchased as specialist, service-led upgrades delivered through ded", "source": "market/沙特报告6W.docx", "dimension": "market", "tags": []},
